  "lang": "ja",
  "title": "MulmoTerminal — 同じリポジトリに2体、それぞれの worktree で",
  "description": "機能紹介の短尺クリップ。タスクごとの git worktree をランチャーから一度のクリックで作り、その中でエージェントが立ち上がる。本体のチェックアウトでは別のエージェントが同時に動き、セルを閉じるときは何が失われるかを先に伝える。スライドは日英とも英語。",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "タスク名を入れて一度押すだけ。MulmoTerminal が git worktree を切って、その中でエージェントを立ち上げます。",
      "image": {
        "type": "html_tailwind",
        "animation": {
          "movie": true
        },
        "html": [
          "<div class='w-full h-full bg-slate-950 relative'>",
          "  <div class='absolute top-8 left-10 text-base tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-slate-600'>Worktree</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute left-0 right-0 text-center text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-100' style='top:64px'>One click, one worktree.</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute' style='top:128px;left:40px;width:1200px'>",
          "    <video src='./mt-worktree-assets/01-create.mp4' autoplay muted playsinline class='rounded-xl shadow-2xl' style='width:1200px;display:block'></video>",
          "  </div>",
          "</div>"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "同じリポジトリに2体が並んで走ります。互いのファイルを踏むことはありません。",
      "image": {
        "type": "html_tailwind",
        "animation": {
          "movie": true
        },
        "html": [
          "<div class='w-full h-full bg-slate-950 relative'>",
          "  <div class='absolute top-8 left-10 text-base tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-slate-600'>Worktree</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute left-0 right-0 text-center text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-100' style='top:64px'>Two agents, one repo.</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute' style='top:128px;left:40px;width:1200px'>",
          "    <video src='./mt-worktree-assets/02-parallel.mp4' autoplay muted playsinline class='rounded-xl shadow-2xl' style='width:1200px;display:block'></video>",
          "  </div>",
          "</div>"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "閉じるときは、何が失われるかを名指しで確認します。削除を選べば、worktree とセルが一緒に消えます。",
      "image": {
        "type": "html_tailwind",
        "animation": {
          "movie": true
        },
        "html": [
          "<div class='w-full h-full bg-slate-950 relative'>",
          "  <div class='absolute top-8 left-10 text-base tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-slate-600'>Worktree</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute left-0 right-0 text-center text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-100' style='top:64px'>It asks before it removes.</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute' style='top:128px;left:40px;width:1200px'>",
          "    <video src='./mt-worktree-assets/03-remove.mp4' autoplay muted playsinline class='rounded-xl shadow-2xl' style='width:1200px;display:block'></video>",
          "  </div>",
          "</div>"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
